  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Tear 4 Eddie**: rare: 5 archived performances [2]\n- **Bannanas and Blow**: rare: 6 archived performances [2]\n- **improv (Girl from Ipenima)**: back after 273 archived shows (2465 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **encore cheers**: rare: 10 archived performances [2]\n- **improv (Hello Dolly)**: back after 273 archived shows (2465 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2006-04-13** (recommended): source not stated; 33 songs; 154 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- After the opening song, Gener told the crowd he had completely lost his voice but would try his best [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2006-04-13**: source: Studio Projects C4 > Aerco MP-2 > Sony TCD-D8 [1]. Also: Recorded with Studio Projects C4 mics into an Aerco MP-2 preamp and a Sony TCD-D8 recorder; Transferred via DA20mkII and Audiophile 2496 into Soundforge, then FLAC; resampled from 48 kHz to 44.1 kHz [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by D.King Gallery: [Ween Concert Posters - D.King Gallery](https://www.dking-gallery.com/store/Ween.html) [3]\n- Poster by D.King Gallery: [Ween Concert Posters - D.King Gallery](https://www.dking-gallery.com/store/Ween.html) [4]",
